var CONTROL_STALE = {};
// The sections of Control: what each is called, where it sits, and the one
// line under its title. The cards carry the old section they were drawn
// under (data-old), so what repaints them is exactly what it was.
/* ==========================================================================
   What root does for the dashboard (5.18): who may reach the pages and the
   firewall, the certificate and how TLS is spoken, a new version, and the
   whole installation backed up and put back. Drawn as otp draws the same
   things - its cards, its popups, its bars - so the two look after a
